                },
                {
                    "text": "Aum Sri Sai Ram Swami \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb",
                    "author": "@rebikarasaily3758",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:10:48Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Jai \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb",
                    "author": "@rebikarasaily3758",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:55:54Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Aum Sri Sai Ram, offering our most humble pranams at the Divine Lotus Feet of our most beloved Bhagwan Swami \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udf39\u2764Samastha Lokah Sukino Bhavantu \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\u2764\ud83c\udf39",
                    "author": "@lathadeviprakash9897",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:11:00Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Omsrisairamnamaha \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83e\udd32\ud83e\udd32\ud83e\udd32\ud83e\udd32\ud83e\udd32",
                    "author": "@nirmalab4984",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:59:30Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Aum Sri Sai Ram koti koti pronam swami at your lotus feet sath raho hameshaaa bless to all Swami \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udf39\ud83d\udd49\ufe0f\ud83d\udd49\ufe0f\ud83c\udf39\ud83d\ude4f",
                    "author": "@dipalimaji1134",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:16:38Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "OM Shree Sai Ram Jai Shree Sai Ram \ud83c\udf39\ud83c\udf39\ud83c\udf39\u2665\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f SWAMI Nanai Eikhoibu Pinabiba Sintha Pumnamak Pangthokchaba Ngamhanbiyu \ud83c\udf39\u2665\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f Samastha Loka Sukhino Bhawantu \ud83c\udf39\u2665\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f",
                    "author": "@saisusantimayanglambam1867",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:27:18Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Sai Ram Sai Ram Sai Ram Sai Ram",
                    "author": "@sreelasubhakaran4957",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:19:00Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Sairam kotishh pranam \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@kiranjoshi1007",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:58:26Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Om Sri Sairam, Bless me swami \ud83d\ude4f",
                    "author": "@tapaschakraborty9960",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T05:39:57Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Omsrisairam god bless me swami \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\udc90\u2665\ufe0f\ud83d\udc4f",
                    "author": "@kursammuthyalarao5155",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T04:39:57Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Om Sai Ram,Om Sai Ram,Om Sai Ram",
                    "author": "@adityakashyap4869",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T06:26:35Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Sairam Swami. Please bless us with good kids Baba. Please come into our family Baba. Please be with us Baba. Please bless us all Baba. Sairam Baba.",
                    "author": "@santoshmadiraju1772",
                    "likes": 0,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-03-09T06:41:46Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "OME NAMO SRI SAI UMA MAHESWARA GOVINDA HARI GOVINDA   \ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\u2764\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udf89",
